{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/10044","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/10044/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/10044/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/10044/events","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues/10044","id":1237140423,"node_id":"I_kwDOAEfiCM5JvUPH","number":10044,"title":"DubboBootstrap.getInstance().getCache().get(ReferenceConfigBase<T>) 没有使用缓存，导致dubbo service的consumer节点持续增加 (zookeeper)","user":{"login":"saleson","id":4346834,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNDY4MzQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4346834?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson","html_url":"https://github.com/saleson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saleson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":7331964,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMxOTY0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/labels/type/bug","name":"type/bug","color":"b60205","default":false,"description":"Bugs to being fixed"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/milestones/52","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/dubbo/milestone/52","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/milestones/52/labels","id":7953575,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAEfiCM4AeVyn","number":52,"title":"3.0.9","description":"","creator":{"login":"chickenlj","id":18097545,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDk3NTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18097545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj","html_url":"https://github.com/chickenlj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":63,"state":"closed","created_at":"2022-05-07T08:07:25Z","updated_at":"2022-06-20T09:02:49Z","due_on":"2022-05-31T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2022-06-20T09:02:49Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2022-05-16T13:13:15Z","updated_at":"2022-06-13T02:32:03Z","closed_at":"2022-06-13T02:31:57Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\r\n### Environment\r\n\r\n* Dubbo version: 3.0.8\r\n* Java version: 1.8\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce this issue\r\n\r\n复现的代码：\r\n```java\r\npublic static GenericService getService(String serviceName, String version){\r\n  ReferenceConfig<GeniricService> refConf = new ReferenceConfig();\r\n  refConf.setProtocol(\"zookeeper\");\r\n  refConf.setAddress(registryAddress);\r\n  refConf.setRegistry(registryConfig);\r\n  refConf.setGeneric(\"true\");\r\n  refConf.setInterface(serviceName);\r\n  refConf.setVersion(version);\r\n  refConf.setTimeout(5000);\r\n  return DubboBootstrap.getInstance().getCache().get(refConf);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Expected Behavior\r\n\r\n从缓存中获取GenericService\r\n\r\n### Actual Behavior\r\n\r\n没有从缓存中获取，而是直接调用了ReferenceConfig.get()，且执行了ReferenceConfig.init()另外创建了新的GenericService， 在zookeeper上也在相应的service节点下添加了consumer节点。\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Reason\r\nDubboBootstrap.getInstance().getCache()返回的是 CompositeReferenceCache类型的对象，CompositeReferenceCache.get(ReferenceConfigBase)方法没有从缓存中取已经创建好的代理类，而是直接调用了ReferenceConfigBase.get()方法，由于ReferenceConfigBase是一个新对象，ReferenceConfigBase.ref==null，最终执行ReferenceConfigBase.init()方法创建代理类并新增consumer节点。\r\nCompositeReferenceCache.get(ReferenceConfigBase)代码如下：\r\n<img width=\"765\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4346834/168599344-1e70b99d-3c90-485f-b0b4-883ada28b64d.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\n该问题在https://github.com/apache/dubbo/issues/10012 也反映过，但仅修复了SimpleReferenceCache类中的bug。\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"chickenlj","id":18097545,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDk3NTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18097545?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj","html_url":"https://github.com/chickenlj","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chickenlj/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/10044/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/10044/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}